From 9155b81bd96d89b59a8118b3b00ad926ee464821 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angelpro09xd <167892325+Angelpro09xd@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:03:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] sapphire: msm_drm: Xiaomi mi_disp display layer like stock

Xiaomi display layer from MiCode vendor_opensource_display-drivers
xun-t-oss (khaje, Longcheer) with the Pad-only bits removed (ktz8866
backlight IC, m84 power sequence, CABC-for-FOD, hardcoded DSI phy
strength), and the sapphire behaviour rebuilt from the stock module:
94 command sets (120/90/60 fps, HBM L1-L5, dimming), mi_disp feature
control, local HBM / FOD, doze/AOD, MiSight (miev) hooks, ESD error IRQ,
/sys/android_lcd and qcom,mdss-brightness-init-level. 48/48 exports and
690/690 imports with stock CRCs, panel config layout identical.

Stock bugs fixed: lc_wp_info 128-byte buffer for a 512-byte param,
strcpy into g_lcd_id, ESD IRQ NULL dereference (&& vs ||), NULL sde_conn
in kickoff, HBM error prints missing arguments.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
